  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, where <math><mi>c</mi></math> is a constant of integration, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>",
